<div id="A1.SS2.SSS0.Px8.p15" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS2.SSS0.Px8.p15.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.SSS0.Px8.p15.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Conclusion:
<br class="ltx_break"></span>There are 5 ‘r’s in “strarrtrabbbery”, at positions 3, 5, 6, 8, and 14. The improved formatting and explicit counting process make this transparent and easy to verify.</p>
